        <h1>Free Statistics Calculators, <em>Explained</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">A plain guide to the Best Answer Hub Statistics Suite: a z-score, confidence interval, p-value, and t-test calculator, each free and run entirely in your browser, and each paired with the one thing people most often get wrong about it. The math is easy to compute; the meaning is where results go sideways, so this guide covers both.</p>
